  "name": "Slug shadowing: detect duplicates, resolve as ambiguous, heal by re-suffix",
  "slug": "slug-shadowing-detect-duplicates-resolve",
  "spec": {
    "summary": "Two clones creating the same slug merge cleanly and the index silently does last-writer-wins (db-index.ts), leaving one ticket unreachable by slug. Detect duplicate slugs at index build (problems entry + stderr warning), make slug resolution of a duplicated slug return AMBIGUOUS_REF listing candidates, and give reindex --heal a deterministic re-suffix repair (older ticket keeps the slug).",
    "details_md": "",
    "acceptance": [
      "Cross-clone slug collision is loud, resolvable, and never silently shadows"
